{"id":"hirn","lemma":"Hirn","pos":"noun","rank":2023,"glosses":["brain (organ)","brain (meat)"],"ipa":"/hɪʁn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/De-Hirn.ogg/De-Hirn.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Hirnes","plural":"Hirne"},"examples":[{"text":"Willst du sagen, dass ich kein Hirn habe?","en":"Are you saying that I don't have a brain?","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not a"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Mein Hirn war leergefegt.","en":"My mind was blank.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392998","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich hoffe, ihr habt genug Hirn, um den Unterschied zu sehen.","en":"I hope you have brains enough to see the difference.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"enough"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"difference"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Und wenn du dir das Hirn zermarterst: du wirst es nicht lösen.","en":"Even if you rack your brains over it, you won't solve it.","words":[{"g":"and"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"the / that"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to loose"}]}]}